WEBVTT

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:04.720
These are really exciting updates for communities.

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:06.720
And there's more!

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:09.200
Today I get to tell you about a new way

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.720
for creators to make money with hype.

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:14.700
Two years ago YouTube introduced Hype

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.700
to help creators under 500K subs

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.720
get their content discovered by fans.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:23.720
It's like a recommendation from the audience.

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:27.720
So far, it's been a huge success.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:30.700
Viewers have hyped over a billion times

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:33.720
across more than 75 million videos.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:37.720
And it's about to get way more powerful with…

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:40.720
Hype with Jewels!

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:44.720
Before, you could only hype three times a week.

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:47.700
Now fans can hype with Jewels

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:50.720
even after their three free hypes run out.

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:53.700
Every Jewels hype adds to the creator's income

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:56.720
and helps the content reach new audiences.

00:00:56.720 --> 00:01:00.200
And the fan's handle will be shown

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:03.720
in the video description as proof of support.

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:08.720
I hope you're as excited as I am about YouTube.

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:11.700
Not just a community or a place to create,

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:14.720
but a place to build a career.

